msgid "Student Path"
msgstr "Student Path"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/student-path.md:3
#: 1c06e3aa4ba740b9b85277cbcaef477a
msgid ""
"Students enter through a Gateway-issued pseudonymous role. Prior suite "
"metrics are useful but optional. When no prior evidence exists, Vigil starts"
" at `lab-01` and records that the absence of history is not a failure."
msgstr ""
"Students enter through a Gateway-issued pseudonymous role. Prior suite "
"metrics are useful but optional. When no prior evidence exists, Vigil starts"
" at `lab-01` and records that the absence of history is not a failure."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/student-path.md:5
#: e1b35068744c4b2b9312d09e03e207f4
msgid "Nine laboratories"
msgstr "Nine laboratories"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/student-path.md:7
#: 7fcff1f92fa847b790cfcf23eef2b62a
msgid "Identify the boundary between scrypt, AEAD and geometry."
msgstr "Identify the boundary between scrypt, AEAD and geometry."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/student-path.md:8
#: a54dae10632848afaeb79660eddd030e
msgid "Inspect an FQLC1 public header."
msgstr "Inspect an FQLC1 public header."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/student-path.md:9
#: bf6f913fc540417091d4154b94e980bb
msgid "Classify useful and avoidable metadata."
msgstr "Classify useful and avoidable metadata."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/student-path.md:10
#: a5b77f293f2b4151b1833219e80ebb2a
msgid "Compare source bytes with a geometric permutation."
msgstr "Compare source bytes with a geometric permutation."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/student-path.md:11
#: e7a98c84327e43f299cf058e9347e127
msgid "Verify exact Apollonian reflections, cycles and symmetry collisions."
msgstr "Verify exact Apollonian reflections, cycles and symmetry collisions."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/student-path.md:12
#: dba6742c046146ca8fd2dd761a2bd7d3
msgid "Run a bounded red-team action against a synthetic fixture."
msgstr "Run a bounded red-team action against a synthetic fixture."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/student-path.md:13
#: c838b1b284574ec59d37238def224c8d
msgid "Apply and document a defensive correction."
msgstr "Apply and document a defensive correction."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/student-path.md:14
#: a7d92ae5b16e4fa29c11eac1347195b7
msgid ""
"Request a minimal metric from another Education tool through Vigil and the "
"Gateway."
msgstr ""
"Request a minimal metric from another Education tool through Vigil and the "
"Gateway."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/student-path.md:15
#: 93ec5142ff714187ad5ffe74b7c222c3
msgid "Assemble a capstone orb and portfolio evidence bundle."
msgstr "Assemble a capstone orb and portfolio evidence bundle."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/student-path.md:17
#: 8937a193b5394c8088710b8a678b1cfa
msgid ""
"Every run records the action, fixture, proof, limitation and Tenebris "
"budgets. A successful action produces evidence, not a grade. Vigil organizes"
" the evidence; a professor retains the final decision."
msgstr ""
"Every run records the action, fixture, proof, limitation and Tenebris "
"budgets. A successful action produces evidence, not a grade. Vigil organizes"
" the evidence; a professor retains the final decision."
